{
  "id": "electrical_equipment___power_consumption",
  "title": "Electrical Equipment - Power Consumption",
  "description": "Calculate energy consumption for common electrical equipment based on power rating and running time. This tool helps estimate the kWh usage for typical household and office appliances.",
  "type": "calculator",
  "components": [
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "## Power Consumption Calculator\n\nThis calculator estimates the energy consumption (in kWh) for electrical equipment based on:\n- **Equipment**: Select from a list of common appliances\n- **Power Rating**: The typical power consumption in watts\n- **Running Time**: How long the equipment runs in hours\n- **Time Period**: Select the calculation period (Daily, Weekly, Monthly, Quarterly, Yearly)\n\n**Formula**: Energy (kWh) = Power (W) × Running Time (h) / 1000"
    },
    {
      "type": "calculator",
      "inputs": [
        {
          "id": "power_rating",
          "label": "Power Rating",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 100,
          "unit": "W"
        },
        {
          "id": "running_time",
          "label": "Running Time",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 1,
          "unit": "h"
        },
        {
          "id": "time_period",
          "label": "Time Period",
          "type": "select",
          "options": [
            {
              "label": "Daily",
              "value": 1
            },
            {
              "label": "Weekly",
              "value": 7
            },
            {
              "label": "Monthly",
              "value": 30
            },
            {
              "label": "Quarterly",
              "value": 91
            },
            {
              "label": "Yearly",
              "value": 365
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "outputs": [
        {
          "id": "daily_consumption",
          "label": "Daily Energy Consumption",
          "unit": "kWh",
          "format": "decimal",
          "formula": "inputs.power_rating * inputs.running_time / 1000"
        },
        {
          "id": "period_consumption",
          "label": "Period Energy Consumption",
          "unit": "kWh",
          "format": "decimal",
          "formula": "inputs.power_rating * inputs.running_time * inputs.time_period / 1000"
        },
        {
          "id": "annual_consumption",
          "label": "Annual Energy Consumption",
          "unit": "kWh",
          "format": "decimal",
          "formula": "inputs.power_rating * inputs.running_time * 365 / 1000"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
